e of Yiling"},"year":"221","month":"5"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1005","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[85,82,77,56,66,47],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"15250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10010","armor":"WP1009605","helmet":"WP1021605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10115","name":{"zh":"征讨南蛮","en":"Southern Campaign"},"year":"225","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[85,82,77,56,66,47],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"15250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10010","armor":"WP1009605","helmet":"WP1021605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[85,82,77,56,66,47],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"15250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10010","armor":"WP1009605","helmet":"WP1021605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[85,82,77,56,66,47],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"15250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10010","armor":"WP1009605","helmet":"WP1021605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[85,82,77,56,66,47],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"15250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10010","armor":"WP1009605","helmet":"WP1021605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[85,82,77,56,66,47],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"15250","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10010","armor":"WP1009605","helmet":"WP1021605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[85,82,77,56,66,47],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"14800","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10010","armor":"WP1009605","helmet":"WP1021605"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[85,82,77,56,66,47],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"14800","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10010","armor":"WP1009605","helmet":"WP1021605"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"吴国武将，为人谨慎负责，深受部下爱戴。至前将军、青州牧，假节，封嘉兴侯。于孙权继位后被其招至麾下。濡须口之战时迎战大将曹仁，以五千兵力抵挡，偃旗息鼓引诱自大的曹仁中伏，斩杀魏将常雕、诸葛虔，生擒王双，送至武昌。在石亭之战时被任命为左都督，击破曹休，斩魏将张普。赤乌元年，朱桓因病去世，时年六十二岁。","tc":"吳國武將，為人謹慎負責，深受部下愛戴。至前將軍、青州牧，假節，封嘉興侯。于孫權繼位后被其招至麾下。濡須口之戰時迎戰大將曹仁，以五千兵力抵擋，偃旗息鼓引誘自大的曹仁中伏，斬殺魏將常雕、諸葛虔，生擒王雙，送至武昌。在石亭之戰時被任命為左都督，擊破曹休，斬魏將張普。赤烏元年，朱桓因病去世，時年六十二歲。","en":"An officer of Wu, known for prudence and responsibility, deeply beloved by his subordinates. He rose to Fore Commander and Governor of Qing Province, was granted ceremonial authority, and was enfeoffed as Marquis of Jiaxing. He entered Sun Quan's service after the latter assumed power. At the Battle of Ruxukou, he confronted the mighty general Cao Ren with just five thousand troops, concealing his banners and muffling his drums to lure the arrogant Cao Ren into an ambush. He slew the Wei generals Chang Diao and Zhuge Qian and captured Wang Shuang alive, sending him to Wuchang. At the Battle of Shiting, he was appointed Left Viceroy, defeating Cao Xiu and killing the Wei general Zhang Pu. In the 1st year of Chiwu, Zhu Huan died of illness at sixty-two.","jp":"呉の武将。慎み深く責任感の強い人柄で、部下から深く慕われた。前将軍、青州牧に至り、節を仮され、嘉興侯に封じられた。孫権が後を継いだ後にその麾下へ招かれた。濡須口の戦いでは大将の曹仁を迎え撃ち、五千の兵力で防戦し、偃旗息鼓して驕る曹仁を誘い込んで伏兵にかけると、魏将の常雕や諸葛虔を斬り、王双を生け捕りにして武昌へと送った。石亭の戦いでは左都督に任じられ、曹休を撃破して魏将の張普を斬った。赤烏元年に病没した。享年六十二。","kr":"오나라의 무장으로, 성품이 신중하고 책임감이 강하여 부하들의 두터운 신망을 받았다. 전장군, 청주목에 이르고 가절을 받았으며 가흥후에 봉해졌다. 손권이 가업을 계승한 뒤 그의 휘하로 등용되었다. 유수구 전투 때는 대장 조인에 맞서 5천의 병력으로 대적하였는데, 기를 눕히고 북을 멈추어 방심한 조인을 유인해 복병에 빠뜨렸으며, 위나라 장수 상조와 제갈건을 참수하고 왕쌍을 사로잡아 무창으로 압송했다. 석정 전투에서는 좌도독으로 임명되어 조휴를 격파하고 위나라 장수 장보를 베었다. 적오 원년, 주환은 병으로 세상을 떠났으니 당시 나이 62세였다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10191","remark":"","surname":"朱","surnameTc":"朱","surnameEn":"Zhu","surnameJp":"朱","surnameKr":"주","surnameOther":"","name":"桓","nameTc":"桓","nameEn":"Huan","nameJp":"桓","nameKr":"환","nameOther":"","word":"休穆","wordTc":"休穆","wordEn":"Xiumu","wordJp":"休穆","wordKr":"휴목","wordOther":"","icon":"朱桓","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"196","city":"CS1053","gender":"0","rule":"85","force":"82","wise":"77","politics":"56","charm":"66","will":"47","ruleTalent":"12","forceTalent":"11","wiseTalent":"9","politicsTalent":"5","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"4","weaponMaster":"31/31/80/31/31/23/50/31","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1000302;1002402","battleSkill":"1001400;1004202","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1002505;S1000102","battleSoul":"1008905","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"7200","battleSoulPoint":"6700","debateSoulPoint":"5900","strategy":"1015415","strategy2":"1010701","professions":"4/4/2/4/0/4/3/0/0/0/3/3/3/2/4/0/2/2/2/0/1/0/0/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"6","compatible":"85","loyalty":"0","reputation":"14800","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"177","show":"196","death":"238","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaki